&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id="unable-to-complete-install-vm-xxxx-didnt-show-up-after-expected-time"&gt;Unable to complete install: &amp;lsquo;VM &amp;lsquo;XXXX&amp;rsquo; didn&amp;rsquo;t show up after expected time.&amp;rsquo;&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#unable-to-complete-install-vm-xxxx-didnt-show-up-after-expected-time" aria-label="Heading self-link"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;使用 virt-manager 安装 VM 时，惦记 Bejin Install 后报错。&lt;/p&gt;
